{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261105/photo/bkn-20261105000626013-1105_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261105001256\"/><p>行動中拘捕一批內地女子。</p><p>荃灣區警員聯同相關部門，根據線報及經深入調查後，昨日（4日）展開代號「嶺馬」的掃黃行動。人員於川龍街、海壩街、大屋街及荃灣街市街一帶，共拘捕7名內地女子，年齡介乎為30至44歲，涉嫌「違反逗留條件」。所有被捕人現正被扣留調查，稍後將交由相關部門跟進。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T16:45:49.648164+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T16:06:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T19:18:40.849992+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T16:38:49.678704+00:00","content_hash":"e22fbe4ed0adb5b52161ad2679fe701072faab1d9a4fb19a8b745525c918eff9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}